# Ignore everything by default
**/*
# Except what's inside src/
!src/**
# ...and signature-webapp/, the standalone member self-service signature app. It
# is a SEPARATE script project with its own clasp target and rootDir, so a push of
# src/ never collects these files and a push of signature-webapp/ never collects
# src/.
!signature-webapp/**
# ...and admin-webapp/, the domain admin help-desk app. Also a SEPARATE script
# project with its own clasp target and rootDir.
!admin-webapp/**
